id: energy-web
name: Energy Web
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score 6+
tpCost: 10
# "While that Opponent remains Pinned through those effects, they suffer from the Guard Down Combat Condition."
bindGuardDown: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Whoever your Binding Pins is Guard Down while they stay Pinned.
text: >
  Energy Web: You can bind your opponent in such a way as to leave them wide open.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score 6+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: If you inflict the Pinned Combat Condition through the Binding Unique Ability, while that Opponent remains
  Pinned through those effects, they suffer from the Guard Down Combat Condition.
